        154.20697021484375,
        521.9949340820312,
        163.89425659179688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "vector α ∈Nn, we associate the monomial xα whose degree is equal to ∥α∥= Pn",
