        89.99996948242188,
        250.40509033203125,
        522.002685546875,
        265.25823974609375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For example, if d = 2 and n = 2, then vd(x) = [1 x1 x2 x1x2 x2",
      "bbox": [
        89.99996948242188,
        265.9937744140625,
        392.95001220703125,
        279.2363586425781
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
