        271.9640197753906,
        394.85845947265625,
        377.4087829589844,
        415.2330017089844
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The moment matrix is semi-definite positive for all d ∈N. We furthermore assume that",
      "bbox": [
        90.00006103515625,
        425.2611999511719,
        522.0110473632812,
        435.55938720703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the matrix is positive definite, which ensures the invertibility of Md.1 With the help of the",
      "bbox": [
        90.00009155273438,
        435.46209716796875,
        522.0205078125,
        450.31524658203125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "moment matrix, the Christoffel function is defined as :",
      "bbox": [
        90.0001220703125,
        452.9701232910156,
        350.2693786621094,
        462.65740966796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Λµ,d(x) =",
      "bbox": [
        225.19412231445312,
        480.25311279296875,
