        489.94036865234375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The following alternative formulation of the Christoffel function can be useful when the",
      "bbox": [
        90.00018310546875,
        505.5550537109375,
        522.06591796875,
        515.2423706054688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
